Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}翻譯：東條路易  後期：Misaki喵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那我告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他回去了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 已經無所謂了
