Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.66,ED_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k69}call {\k18}my {\k35}name {\k38} {\k15}ま{\k33}だ{\k36}僕{\k15}で{\k11}居{\k14}る{\k24}の{\k30}な{\k45}ら
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:22:05.38,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k20}不{\k46}安{\k68}で{\k74}揺{\k48}ら{\k17}い{\k12}で{\k30}い{\k77}た{\k33} {\k34}弱{\k10}い{\k99}心{\k106}に{\k22}差{\k47}す{\k81}光{\k67}の{\k70}残{\k67}像{\k30}と
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.53,0:22:09.20,ED_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k37}こ{\k14}の{\k12}手{\k16}の{\k37}微{\k24}か{\k7}な{\k31}温{\k15}も{\k31}り{\k30}を{\k49} riding {\k19}on {\k15}the {\k30}wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:14.91,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k17}い{\k16}つ{\k20}か{\k10}見{\k17}た{\k32}空{\k29}想{\k109}を{\k27}{\k118}重{\k29}ね{\k147}て
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,so I'd never known 'cause blind myself
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,この世界を飛び交う嘘の決め事を
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,but I know it's easy to escape
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,まだ 迷いは...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,and I know it's hard to erase away
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,それでも 鳴り止まぬ音に...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,確かめていたいよ なんて
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,何処に潜んでいるんでもなくて
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,回り出した fair wind still be destination
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,,後悔を先回りして断つのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.13,0:22:19.76,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k25}明{\k14}日{\k15}が{\k59}怖{\k38}く{\k21}な{\k6}っ{\k20}た{\k14}っ{\k37}て{\k12} {\k31}僕{\k11}と{\k17}い{\k18}う{\k34}そ{\k20}の{\k39}全{\k32}て
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:22.23,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k31}up {\k11}to {\k35}fair {\k35}wind {\k29}gonna {\k35}true {\k71}location
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:27.98,ED_JP2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k34}信{\k19}じ{\k18}て{\k12}た{\k35}僕{\k18}を{\k20}引{\k9}き{\k19}ず{\k13}り{\k15}出{\k15}し{\k10}て{\k19}行{\k41}く{\k10}ん{\k268}だ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:34.80,ED_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k64}風{\k20}を{\k29}呼{\k18}ん{\k63}で{\k39}... {\k30}all {\k14}the {\k50}way {\k253}around
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:08.07,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,It's always...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:14.27,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,because it's always I try my way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:18.48,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,It's always...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:23.52,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,because it's always I try my way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.87,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,無論是瘋狂躁動不已地枯竭心跳也好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:29.33,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,還是想去依賴信仰的呼吸也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.46,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,I hear my voice in the cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.76,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,假裝不在乎 其實並不想分開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:37.54,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,依然放棄 原地踏步的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:39.88,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,還沒有真正地成為我自己呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.55,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,I've found no words
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:43.88,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,但是當我回頭的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:50.60,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,卻發現那個還相信著最初最真的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:54.79,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,踏出依然顫抖的腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:57.38,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,'cause I don't wanna be a looser when I used to be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:21:04.17,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,讓光線透進來 解開枷鎖的大門
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:09.31,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,因為我想要去確認 即使它仍潛藏在某處
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.31,0:21:12.52,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,踏遍各地  fair wind still be destination
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:15.42,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,首先把理論都通通丟掉再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:20.09,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,因為恐懼而掩蔽的真實 還有這名為我的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:22.50,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,up to fair wind gonna true location
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:28.31,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,一邊放大著美好 一遍踏著艱難的步伐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:34.73,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,呼喚著風... all the way around
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.71,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,自在變換形狀的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:40.16,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,以及暴露出現實的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:42.12,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,I hear your voice in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:45.53,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,沒錯 我清楚的 我清楚的很啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:50.68,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,即使蔚藍的天空不復存在 就算黑暗將一切都給蓋過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.66,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,呼喚我的名字 如果我還在的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:22:05.38,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,照向軟弱的心 因為不安而搖曳的光明與投影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.53,0:22:09.20,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,將這雙手還僅存的溫度 riding on the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:14.91,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,與那天我們看見的想像相互重疊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.13,0:22:19.76,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,即使開始懼怕明天的到來 名為我的這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:22.23,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,up to fair wind gonna true location
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:27.98,ED_TW2,,0,0,0,,將會伸出手 拉曾經相信過的我一把
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:34.80,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,呼喚著風... all the way around
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 秋月
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,自從相遇的那一刻開始 妳就一直很胡來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我總是被妳耍的團團轉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 妳讓我發現了 音樂和夥伴有多麼重要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因為有妳在 我的世界竟然變得如此寬廣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我從今以後 也要永遠和妳在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:20.60,phone,,0,0,0,,{\frz23.15\pos(768,960)}出道計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:20.60,phone,,0,0,0,,{\frz24.76\pos(1066,972)}簡報資料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:20.60,phone,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fn@MHGHagoromoTHK-Light\pos(1720,480)\c&H0100A7&\frz312.8}企業機密
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 小優
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才許了什麼願望？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那個..希望貝斯能更精進
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.17,0:23:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,還有..
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.05,0:23:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能永遠和風夏在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這樣我才不想說出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,從今以後也永遠在一起吧
